#: ../../source/docs/common-synerex-mdu-2000.rst:11
#: d9ac18921e824f489d50a42d6fe7feee
msgid "MDU-2000 UAV Kit is a GNSS RTK receiver for UAV with dual antenna support that provides centimeter-level position and heading in real time. MBC RTK service guarantees less than 3cm latitude/longitude error and 10cm altitude error. It supports azimuth using dual antenna RTK technology instead of conventional external COMPASS, which is greatly affected by metals or electromagnetic fields, enabling more stable flight near high-voltage power lines and large structures."
msgstr ""

